{"data": [{"author_id": "188369814", "created_at": "2026-11-10T14:18:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120159280355828165"], "id": "2120159280355828165", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 26, "impression_count": 35012, "like_count": 149, "quote_count": 5, "reply_count": 46, "retweet_count": 27}, "text": "There was no Oct. 2025 CPI (Gov't shutdown) so no y/y CPI with today Oct. 2026 release.\n\nBlack line below is the CORE CPI 11-month annualized rate. It ROSE to 2.92%.\n\nOrange line is the last 3-month annualized rate. At 3.75%, a 2 1/2 year high. \n\nCore inflation is a problem! https://t.co/EfuanarKM2", "url": "https://x.com/biancoresearch/status/2120159280355828165"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-11-10T14:12:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120157586733326384"], "id": "2120157586733326384", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 57, "impression_count": 38341, "like_count": 492, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 31, "retweet_count": 46}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120149208338686137", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Usually there's a way to slice a CPI report so that you have some kind of glimmer of good news. https://t.co/RZCxhShWtw", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2120157586733326384"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-11-10T14:01:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120154765069787268"], "id": "2120154765069787268", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 19325, "like_count": 106, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 12}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120154292736987188", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "https://t.co/FHn16MrkDP https://t.co/ku5YXWkh3J", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2120154765069787268"}, {"author_id": "497231011", "created_at": "2026-11-10T13:58:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120154244695109783"], "id": "2120154244695109783", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 2370, "like_count": 12, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 5}, "text": "READ THIS ONE WHILE SITTING DOWN:\n\n\"#Moonshot AI accessed a trove of Nvidia’s most advanced chips this summer, according to documents filed w/Beijing regulators, highlighting the Chinese #AI champion’s reliance on American hardware despite US export restrictions.\n\nThe firm behind", "url": "https://x.com/ChinaBeigeBook/status/2120154244695109783"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-11-10T13:57:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120153756973310061"], "id": "2120153756973310061", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 12, "impression_count": 31875, "like_count": 119, "quote_count": 6, "reply_count": 12, "retweet_count": 14}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118705588280479823", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Last week, odds of a December rate hike were at 78%. After that CPI report, odds of a 25 basis point hike are above 100% (meaning that there's some chance of a 50 bps rate hike) https://t.co/Lu7LBMwnwF https://t.co/5C2LYNsyoc", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2120153756973310061"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-11-10T13:52:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120152645855859038"], "id": "2120152645855859038", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 14, "impression_count": 31402, "like_count": 245, "quote_count": 4, "reply_count": 11, "retweet_count": 34}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120152232154779818", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Second worst month for food away from home since 2023 https://t.co/P8qCYRbvbe https://t.co/SArf4LIFk3", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/status/2120152645855859038"}, {"author_id": "14096763", "created_at": "2026-11-10T13:50:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120152232154779818"], "id": "2120152232154779818", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 13, "impression_count": 65916, "like_count": 165, "quote_count": 10, "reply_count": 11, "retweet_count": 58}, "text": "Food prices surged in October https://t.co/z4eZzF1jZw", "url": "https://x.com/TheStalwart/statu